# LIORA — Fashion E-Commerce Website

## 📌 Project Overview

LIORA is a fashion-focused web application developed as my
Diploma Main Project in Information Technology.

The project was created to apply practical web development,
responsive design and database development concepts.

## 🛠️ Technologies

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- PHP
- MySQL

## ✨ Features

- Responsive user interface
- Fashion product presentation
- Product browsing
- User-friendly navigation
- PHP-based functionality
- MySQL database integration

## 🎯 Project Goals

The main goal of the project was to develop a practical
fashion web application while applying concepts learned
during my Diploma in Information Technology.

## 📱 Responsive Design

The interface was designed to work across:

- Desktop
- Tablet
- Mobile

## 🗄️ Database

The project uses MySQL for database-related functionality.

## 🧪 Testing

Testing was performed during development to identify
interface, functionality and responsive-design issues.

## 📸 Screenshots

Screenshots of the application are included below.

## 🚀 Running the Project

1. Install a local PHP development environment.
2. Create the required MySQL database.
3. Import the provided database SQL file.
4. Configure the local database connection.
5. Start the PHP server.
6. Open the project in a browser.

## 📚 Learning Outcomes

Through this project I gained practical experience in:

- Front-end development
- Responsive web design
- PHP
- MySQL
- Database-driven web applications
- Problem solving
- Testing

